Rhun style and implementation-model reference:
https://github.com/vshvedov/rhun
The custom pixel canvas, Win32 presentation and compact monospace UI model
were used as design references. No Rhun source code or assets were copied.
The UI uses the Windows system font Consolas; no font file is distributed.

Reference C implementations and oracle programs are development/test inputs
only. Native LAMP runtime sources and all codec implementations linked
into its executables are x86-64 assembly.
